# AUTHORED-BY Codex GPT-6.1-Sol
#
# Normative-statement companion for the Yjs Sync Profile for Solid Storages.
# The full text in index.html is the normative document. Quotes strip tags, decode
# entities, unbracket [[refs]] and collapse whitespace, as tools/spec-check verifies.
# One requirement per normative paragraph; mixed-keyword paragraphs use their first
# keyword for the single level required by the companion model.
#
# Testability: E = Enforceable (observable documents or exchanges);
# A-int = AccountableIntegrity (uniformity/concurrent authorization and room-deletion properties);
# A-exist = AccountableExistence (random-source or logging implementation audits);
# P = Premature (not testable as specified; no paragraph is classified P here).
# Test-case links identify manifest case IDs. A link covers only that case's byte or
# loading assertion; remaining HTTP, reporting and compaction checks have explicit gaps.

